     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<div><br></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">MSstatsQC and its\r\ngraphical user interface, MSstatsQCgui, are two R/Bioconductor packages for\r\nstatistical analysis for longitudinal system suitability and quality control (QC) of mass\r\nspectrometry-based proteomics experiments. </font></span><br></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">They are available through Bioconductor (links below) </span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/MSstatsQC.html\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/MSstatsQC.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231725496000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2g58ObjqdASJ2qAKr-hAse\">https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/MSstatsQC.html</a> </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span></span><span></span><a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/MSstatsQCgui.html\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/MSstatsQCgui.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231725496000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fl8gu2sggQfdVQLcbaBwA\">https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/MSstatsQCgui.html</a> </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span></span>Project documentation is also available through <a href=\"http://www.msstats.org/msstatsqc\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-size:13px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.msstats.org/msstatsqc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231725496000&amp;usg=AOvVaw23LQcjHSn5kPHgqNGCZZvQ\">www.msstats.org/msstatsqc</a><span style=\"font-size:13px\">. </span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-size:13px\"></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Please use </span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/msstatsqc\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!forum/msstatsqc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231725496000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FP4yktphe2-ZlbVQtdUm6\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/msstatsqc</a> for help and bug reports. <span></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><span></span><span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">We will stay in touch with the new updates and please don&#39;t hesitate to reach out to us for any questions. </div></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Many thanks,</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Eralp</div></div>"
